      "text": "Three decisions locked, everything here follows from them:\n1. The library is mirinjs \u2014 that is the wordmark. The binary stays `mirin`.\n2. The logo IS Kome, face and all. No separate abstract mark.\n3. Amber is the only accent; indigo #6d6df0 is retired."
